// Axiom Compiler — Pass Contracts, Proof-Carrying IR & Fail-Closed Gate (compiler/verify/pass_contracts/mod.ax)
// Implements SPEC-25 (AXS-PCT-001..015, AXS-PCT-050..053, INV-PCT-001):
//   - PassContract descriptors (IrLevel, AnalysisKind, SemanticProperty, ValidationStrategy,
//     PassFailurePolicy) and canonical PassContractRegistry (AXS-PCT-001..002).
//   - Three-valued static Certainty lattice (Proven, Possible, Unknown) with fail-closed
//     degradation on budget exhaustion, FFI/indirect boundaries, volatile/NaN hazards (AXS-PCT-010).
//   - ProofCertificate & ProofProvenance with canonical 128-bit Fingerprint128 caching and
//     automatic transitive invalidation on IR mutation or root fact invalidation (AXS-PCT-011).
//   - Shared monotone dataflow fixed-point engine & multi-category EffectSummary lattices
//     (Memory, Resource, Control, Concurrency, External) with Drop/callback/SCC rules (AXS-PCT-012..013).
//   - Bounded in-process SymbolicValueDomain (Constant, Range, Nullability, Bitmask, Congruence)
//     proving NonZero, ShiftInRange, InBounds, and NoOverflow with zero external SMT (AXS-PCT-014).
//   - Auditable FactOrigin.TrustedBoundary tracking (AXS-PCT-015).
//   - Transactional pass execution gate (semantic firewall separating profitability from semantic
//     proofs, clean IR rollback on Possible/Unknown obligations, and --verify-pass-contracts
//     post-pass verification emitting AX_ICE_INTERNAL / AX_ICE_MIR_VERIFY with
//     data.stage = "pass_contract", AXS-PCT-003..005, AXS-PCT-050..053).
module compiler.verify.pass_contracts

